# Secrets never belong in this repo — the chain takes its config from config.yml
# locally and from the SDL's env block when deployed. This is here because a bare
# `.env` pattern in the backend repo matched only that exact name, and a
# `.env.local` carrying a wallet mnemonic reached a public repository through the
# gap. `.env*` covers the family.
.env*
